{
 "file": "EN/EVENT_DATA/MESSAGE/E000/E099_010.BMD",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "...Eureka!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "What's the deal?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Huh?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Nyahaha... Curious, eh? Well, I've come up[n]with a super cool idea.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "I just had an idea—and a phenomenal[n]one, at that.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Lady Ann will surely swoon for me if I—",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Sorry for the wait.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "So, what's up, Morgana?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Something about you, Ann.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_006_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Supposedly, you'll swoon.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "You were talking about... me?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "From what?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Well...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "It's something I've been giving a lot[n]of thought lately.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Now that we've all gained some[n]experience in battle, I think it'd be[n]good for us to work on our finishers.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Our finishers?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_011_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Yeah, I guess if we're going to keep[n]fighting, we ought to do it with style.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Right? Right!?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "So, I came up with just the idea...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#2",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "It's maybe my best one yet! And we can[n]definitely pull it off if you play a part[n]in it, Lady Ann!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Me?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_014_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Well, okay—what do you need me to do?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Now that's our Lady Ann! Quick on[n]the uptake.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "What I had in mind was...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_016_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "...And that should do the trick!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_017_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Really?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "So, is that a no?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Well, it's not that I don't want to...[n]it's more like, isn't your idea sorta[n]impossible? Even in the Metaverse?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Huh? What was that?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_022_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "The star Jose gave to us[n]started glimmering...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_022_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Could it have reacted[n]to something...?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ryuji",
   "en": "'Sup?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
}